deceniu. Știința din spatele creatinei a evoluat, arătând că modul în care corpul tău procesează fosfocreatina se schimbă dramatic pe măsură ce înaintezi în vârstă.</p>\n\n<a href=\"https://primesupplements.ro/products/creatina-creapure\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0917/5138/3415/files/01_PRIME_CREATINE_Creapure_500g_front_508a0239-fe0e-4167-9d15-12bc1a93fc8c.jpg?v=1749666722\" alt=\"Supliment de creatine monohydrate pură pentru performanță sportivă și sănătate în 2026\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; margin: 20px 0;\"></a>\n<div class=\"buy-now-card cta product-card\" style=\"margin: 30px 0; padding: 20px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f8fafc, #f1f5f9); border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 20px; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n    \n    <a href=\"https://primesupplements1.myshopify.com/products/creatina-creapure\" class=\"product-image\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"flex-shrink: 0;\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0917/5138/3415/files/01_PRIME_CREATINE_Creapure_500g_front_508a0239-fe0e-4167-9d15-12bc1a93fc8c.jpg?v=1749666722\" alt=\"Creatine (Creapure®)\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width: 120px; height: 120px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;\">\n    </a>\n    \n    <div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\">\n      <a href=\"https://primesupplements1.myshopify.com/products/creatina-creapure\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n        <h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: #1e293b;\">Creatine (Creapure®)</h4>\n      </a>\n      \n      <p style=\"margin: 0 0 4px 0; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: #ea8a8a;\">180.00 lei</p>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 13px; color: #d97706; font-weight: 500;\">⚡ În limi